Subject: [PATCH] [Attention] Add experimental ZoomKV backend

Integrate hierarchical sparse KV retrieval and optional K+V CPU offload so vLLM v0.20.0 can evaluate long-context ZoomKV workloads with documented accuracy and latency tooling.

